      <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00001754> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bomb" .


###  http://www.semanticweb.org/vlunc/ontologies/2026/9/DynamicTargeting/Chief_Of_Combat_Operations_Role
:Chief_Of_Combat_Operations_Role rdf:type owl:Class ;
