                                     ] ;
                     rdfs:label "Dynamic Target Role" ;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A Military Target Role that is realized by a Process that some Agent is the object of a unschedule or unplanned potential military action given some operational requirement." .


